        "subject": "=[URGENT] This week's menu is still not published - Victoria TL3",
        "emailFormat": "html",
        "html": "=<h2>&#128680; Alert: the menu has not been updated</h2>\n<p>Dear Principal,</p>\n<p>Following Thursday's reminder, this week's menu is <strong>still incomplete</strong>.</p>\n<h3>Days still missing:</h3>\n<ul>\n{{ $json.missing_days.map(d => '<li>' + d + '</li>').join('\\n') }}\n</ul>\n<p>Under Circular 09/2024, the menu must be published on the school website. Please coordinate with the boarding-meals team to complete it.</p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>Automated email from the Victoria TL3 system. The boarding-meals team is copied.</em></p>",
        "options": {
